        "pk": 2529,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 5023,
            "candidate": 200,
            "answer_feedback": "Okay, Our plan with this manifesto is that it will play best within two regions. It will be strong in London we believe, as well as possibly being strong in Scotland if you play your cards right."
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer_feedback",
        "pk": 2530,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 5024,
            "candidate": 200,
            "answer_feedback": "Hmm… Whilst this appeared like a good strategy at first, it seems voters are demanding more than just “not being Corbyn”. Let’s hope it doesn’t affect them turning out for the Conservatives."
